StockKeep — LIVE PRODUCTION Deployment Evidence
Target: https://ai-stock-keep-tracker.vercel.app/
Generated: 2026-08-13, ~23:32 UTC

===== DEF-06 (discovered live, not in original local testing): systemic database failure on Vercel =====
Before fix (commits up to 24e6371): GET /api/items, /api/analytics, /api/settings all returned
  HTTP 500 {"error":"Failed to fetch ..."} on the LIVE deployment specifically (never reproduced
  locally). Root cause: Vercel's serverless filesystem is read-only outside /tmp; the bundled
  prisma/dev.db SQLite file could not be reliably opened there. This is TD-08 manifesting in
  production, discovered only by testing the actual live URL after the other fixes shipped.

Fix (commit 45431f4): next.config.ts outputFileTracingIncludes + src/lib/prisma.ts copies
  dev.db into /tmp on cold start (Vercel only) and points PrismaClient at the writable copy.
  GET /api/settings also gained a safe-default fallback for defense in depth.

